  "job_B1.4.1_20251001_193227": {
    "chunk_text": "\ufffdr he sang be \u00feam Worde, & \u00e6fter be \u00feam Wisdome. Paulus se apostol eac on his pistole awrat be urum H\u00e6lende criste & cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6s halgan Eac s\u00e6don sume h\u00e6\u00f0ne on heora gesetnessum \u00fe\u00e6t we sceolon gelyfan on \u00feone so\u00fean god \u00fee wilt \u00fea An h\u00e6\u00f0en mann w\u00e6s iu on egypta lande \u00e6r cristes acennednysse, & he cydde be Criste, Hermes He awrat ane boc, \u00fee hatte \u00feuss on Leden: Uerbum Perfectum, \u00fe\u00e6t is, Fulfremed Word. Word \u00fe\u00e6t ge magon gehyran hu se so\u00f0lice oncneow: Filius benedicti Dei atque bon\u00e6 uoluntatis, cuius \u00d0us wrat se Hermes on his gesetnysse be \u00feam \u00e6lmihtigan F\u00e6der & his ancennedan Suna, & het hine Fela we mihton secgan swylcera gewitnyssa \u00feurh h\u00e6\u00f0ene witegan be \u00feam heofonlican Gode, gyf us to On anginne w\u00e6s Word, & \u00fe\u00e6t Word w\u00e6s mid Gode, and \u00fe\u00e6t Word w\u00e6s God. \u00d0is w\u00e6s on anginne mid \u00feam \u00e6lmihtigan Gode. Sume gedwolmen dweledon on geleafan & noldon gelyfan \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s lyfigendan Godes Sunu w\u00e6re \u00e6fre Her ge magon gehyran on \u00feisum halgan godspelle \u00fe\u00e6t o\u00f0er is se F\u00e6der, o\u00f0er is se Sunu, & o\u00f0er is se Seo an godcundnyss \u00fee him eallum is gem\u00e6ne nele na ge\u00feafian \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00fery godas syndon, ne \u00fe\u00e6t heora Ealle \u00feing syndon gesceapene \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t Word, & butan \u00feam Worde",
